+- [ ] **PREVIEW-007**: When a request references a preview key whose sheet is resident in the first-use queue (the queue of sheets requested once), the preview worker SHALL promote the sheet to the hot queue (the queue of sheets requested more than once) as that queue's most recently used entry, unless the sheet is larger than the hot queue's configured cap, in which case the preview worker SHALL leave the sheet in the first-use queue.
